<title>USA: Computer Integration Corp Q4 loss vs net.</title>
<headline>Computer Integration Corp Q4 loss vs net.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share)</p>
<p>			  Three Months Ended    Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>			   6/30/96   6/30/95     6/30/96    6/30/95</p>
<p> Net Sales	    $105,955  $ 58,388    $449,954   $209,226</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)*  (2,107)	 348	 (403)	1,133</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss)</p>
<p>Per Share --</p>
<p>  Fully Diluted*	 (.31)	 .05	 (.09)	  .15</p>
<p>Avg diluted shrs  6,920,548  6,409,000  6,916,383  6,409,000</p>
<p>NOTE: * Net loss for the three months and 12 months ended June 30, 1996 reflect a non-recurring pre-tax special charge of $2.3 million for restructuring costs related to the planned relocation and consolidation of headquarters, sales and distribution facilities.</p>
<p>Net loss for the fiscal year ended June 30, 1996 also reflects non-recurring pre-tax costs of $486,000 related to a public offering which was not completed.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
